A||||20||Black86SE||Blinkers: Now a factory option?||||1||
Z||000000||Black86SE||11-20-2001||01:42 AM||||What is it these days with poeple in new cars and not using their blinkers? On my way home from work tonight I must have seen like 3 people in new cars NOT using their blinkers when turning. The best thing that my friends and I can come up with is that it is now a factory option. It must be an option cause my dad's new Bonneville SSEI has them. I have used them, honest!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Just talking for no apparent reason||||reg||1
Z||000001||tgowens||11-20-2001||05:22 AM||||blinkers? Oh, I thought you said <I>blinders</I> - most of those people drive with blinders on rather than their blinkers..... but, then again, <I>some</I> people drive for miles and miles and miles with their blinker on.........<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature_TGO.jpg"> <P><A HREF="http://www.cfog-i.org" TARGET=_blank>Classic Fiero Owners Group International</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Tigger||11-20-2001||08:29 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by tgowens:<BR><B>but, then again, <I>some</I> people drive for miles and miles and miles with their blinker on.........<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hehe, kinda makes up for those who don't use em.  I'm with you, thing is some new cars have them there blinkers in the side mirrors.  Engineers spend years developing the turn signal lever and everything that goes with it, where it's positioned to be comfortable to be used everything.  They even go as far on some high end cars to get the perfect texture for the knob and signal stalk.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Raydar||11-20-2001||08:51 AM||||The ones I really like  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> are the ones that have to whip over in front of you (into the fast lane), cutting you off, without using a blinker. (Do BMWs come equipped with blinkers?) One day I'm going to bunt one of these a$$#oles into the median.  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||8
