Z||000011||fierospeeder||11-20-2001||11:27 PM||||i almost got tboned by a lady when i "thought" she was going to make a right hand turn into my street.  She had her blinder on, and i said, hey i can pull out and make my right turn.  OH sh**t shes coming 30mph at me.  So she swerves around.  I followed her for a mile and she turns off on that street.   i cant remember, but i think she had her turn signal on for a while then she turned it off.<P>Now i will always wait until the car has its wheels turned before i turn.<P>I like the people that signal WHILE they are turning.||||reg||1
